{
  "_readme": [
    "Golden set for the WSP validation POC. LABEL BEFORE RUNNING, and re-check the",
    "hints against out/report/chunks.json before scoring -- an unverified hint scores",
    "retrieval as a miss even when retrieval was right.",
    "",
    "Two stages are scored separately (score_golden.py):",
    "  retrieval  recall@k -- did a chunk matching evidence_hint reach the top k?",
    "  judgment   verdict accuracy given correct retrieval.",
    "A blended number cannot tell you whether to fix chunking/embedding or the rubric.",
    "",
    "'verified' marks whether a human has confirmed the label against the manual.",
    "Everything below starts false except the synthetic fixture items, which are true",
    "by construction (the fixture text was written to satisfy those articles).",
    "",
    "Runs: 'sample_wsp' = Sample WSP.pdf (WealthForge) extracted WITH --with-synthetic;",
    "      'triad_wsp'  = WSP Sample.pdf (Triad) extracted WITHOUT the fixture."
  ],
  "runs": {
    "sample_wsp": {
      "source_pdf": "docs/research/WSP Analysis/Sample WSP.pdf",
      "extract_flags": ["--with-synthetic"],
      "items": [
        {"id": "sw-01", "regulation": "DORA", "article": 11, "expected_verdict": "covered",
         "evidence_hint": ["ICT business continuity policy", "Z.1"],
         "note": "synthetic fixture section Z.1", "verified": true},
        {"id": "sw-02", "regulation": "DORA", "article": 17, "expected_verdict": "covered",
         "evidence_hint": ["ICT-related incident management process", "Z.2"],
         "note": "synthetic fixture section Z.2", "verified": true},
        {"id": "sw-03", "regulation": "MiCA", "article": 70, "expected_verdict": "covered",
         "evidence_hint": ["safeguard the ownership rights", "Z.3"],
         "note": "synthetic fixture section Z.3", "verified": true},

        {"id": "sw-04", "regulation": "DORA", "article": 9, "expected_verdict": "partial",
         "evidence_hint": ["cybersecurity"],
         "note": "Appendix L rep cybersecurity policy -- protection/prevention only",
         "verified": false},
        {"id": "sw-05", "regulation": "MiCA", "article": 66, "expected_verdict": "partial",
         "evidence_hint": ["communications with the public", "advertising"],
         "note": "fair, clear, not misleading communications", "verified": false},
        {"id": "sw-06", "regulation": "MiCA", "article": 71, "expected_verdict": "partial",
         "evidence_hint": ["customer complaint", "complaints"],
         "note": "FINRA complaint handling covers some of the Art. 71 obligations",
         "verified": false},
        {"id": "sw-07", "regulation": "MiCA", "article": 72, "expected_verdict": "partial",
         "evidence_hint": ["conflicts of interest"], "verified": false},
        {"id": "sw-08", "regulation": "MiCA", "article": 92, "expected_verdict": "partial",
         "evidence_hint": ["insider", "material non-public information"],
         "note": "insider trading chapter -- market abuse detection, not MiCA-specific",
         "verified": false},

        {"id": "sw-09", "regulation": "MiCA", "article": 59, "expected_verdict": "gap",
         "evidence_hint": [], "note": "CASP authorisation -- US broker-dealer manual",
         "verified": false},
        {"id": "sw-10", "regulation": "MiCA", "article": 75, "expected_verdict": "gap",
         "evidence_hint": [], "note": "custody of crypto-assets", "verified": false},
        {"id": "sw-11", "regulation": "MiCA", "article": 77, "expected_verdict": "gap",
